This repository and the website built from it
(https://mahkhalid19.github.io/AttarDocs/) contain the documentation for the
ATTAR Shopify theme: its text, page design, stylesheets, layouts and
generated reference pages (together, the "Documentation"). The Documentation
is protected by copyright. It is published openly so that merchants can set
up and run stores that use the ATTAR theme. No license is granted except as
described below.

YOU MAY

  1. Read the Documentation online.
  2. Print or save copies of individual pages for your own use while you set
     up, run or support a store that uses the ATTAR theme.
  3. Link to any page of the Documentation.
  4. Quote short excerpts, with credit to "ATTAR theme documentation" and a
     link to the page quoted.

YOU MAY NOT, WITHOUT PRIOR WRITTEN PERMISSION FROM THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER

  1. Copy, republish, mirror or redistribute the Documentation, in whole or
     in substantial part, on any website, repository, marketplace or other
     medium.
  2. Modify the Documentation, translate it or create derivative works from
     it, including documentation, guides or support content for any other
     theme, template or product.
  3. Sell the Documentation or include it in any paid product or service.
  4. Use the Documentation to build, train, fine-tune or evaluate machine
     learning or artificial intelligence systems or datasets.
  5. Remove or change this notice or any copyright notice in the
     Documentation.

